          "html": "<details class=\"reference-disclosure\"><summary>點選展開／收合完整 Reference</summary><div class=\"reference-content\"><h3>主要整理來源</h3><p>黃品叡醫師，PGY 職前加油站。《臨床抗生素基礎入門：Clinical Antibiotics — A Practical Primer for PGY》，2026 更新版，Ver. 3.0，共 35 頁。原檔名：23 -【PGY職前加油站】臨床抗生素基礎入門.pdf。</p><h3>本次校核來源</h3><ul><li><strong>C1.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.idsociety.org/practice-guideline/amr-guidance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IDSA 2026 Guidance on AMR Gram-Negative Infections</a></li><li><strong>C2.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.idsociety.org/practice-guideline/complicated-urinary-tract-infections/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IDSA 2025 Complicated UTI Guideline</a></li><li><strong>C3.</strong> <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa2404991\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BALANCE：7 vs 14 Days in Bloodstream Infection</a></li><li><strong>C4.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-approves-new-antibiotic-three-different-uses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA：Ceftobiprole 核准用途及 VAP 警示</a></li><li><strong>C5.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.idsociety.org/practice-guideline/clostridioides-difficile-2021-focused-update/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHEA/IDSA 2021 CDI Focused Update</a></li><li><strong>C6.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.idsociety.org/practice-guideline/vancomycin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ASHP/IDSA/PIDS/SIDP 2020 Vancomycin Monitoring</a></li></ul><h3>原講義所列參考資料（28 筆）</h3><p>以下依原講義 pp. 34–35 轉錄，未逐筆驗證書目、給付或最新版本；不表示已直接閱讀全部原始資料。網站的校核補充以本節 C1–C6 為準。</p><ol class=\"references\"><li>Tamma PD, Bonomo RA, Heil EL, Justo JA, Mathers AJ, Satlin MJ, et al. Infectious Diseases Society of America 2026 Guidance on the Treatment of Antimicrobial-Resistant Gram-Negative Infections. Clin Infect Dis. 2026.（取代 2023／2024 版；涵蓋 ESBL-E、AmpC-E、 CRE、DTR-P. aeruginosa、CRAB、S. maltophilia）</li><li>IDSA. 2025 Guidelines on the Management and Treatment of Complicated Urinary Tract Infections. Clin Infect Dis. 2025.</li><li>Rybak MJ, Le J, Lodise TP, et al. Therapeutic Monitoring of Vancomycin for Serious MRSA Infections: A Revised Consensus Guideline of ASHP / IDSA / PIDS / SIDP. Am J Health-Syst Pharm. 2020;77(11):835-864.（AUC/MIC 400–600）</li><li>Metlay JP, Waterer GW, Long AC, et al. Diagnosis and Treatment of Adults with Community-acquired Pneumonia. ATS/IDSA Clinical Practice Guideline. Am J Respir Crit Care Med. 2019;200(7):e45-e67.（正式廢除 HCAP 分類）</li><li>Kalil AC, Metersky ML, Klompas M, et al. Management of Adults With Hospital-acquired and Ventilator-associated Pneumonia: IDSA/ ATS Clinical Practice Guidelines. Clin Infect Dis. 2016;63(5):e61-e111.</li><li>Clinical and Laboratory Standards Institute. M100: Performance Standards for Antimicrobial Susceptibility Testing, 36th ed. Wayne, PA: CLSI; 2026.</li><li>Evans L, Rhodes A, Alhazzani W, et al. Surviving Sepsis Campaign: International Guidelines for Management of Sepsis and Septic Shock. Crit Care Med / Intensive Care Med. 2021.</li><li>BALANCE Investigators. Antibiotic Treatment for 7 versus 14 Days in Patients with Bloodstream Infections. N Engl J Med. 2025;392(11): 1065-1078.（n=3,608；90 天死亡率 14.5% vs 16.1%，7 天不劣於 14 天）</li><li>Harris PNA, Tambyah PA, Lye DC, et al. Effect of Piperacillin-Tazobactam vs Meropenem on 30-Day Mortality for Patients With E. coli or K. pneumoniae Bloodstream Infection and Ceftriaxone Resistance（MERINO trial）. JAMA. 2018;320(10):984-994.</li><li>Kaye KS, Shorr AF, Wunderink RG, et al. Efficacy and safety of sulbactam-durlobactam versus colistin for the treatment of patients with serious infections caused by Acinetobacter baumannii-calcoaceticus complex（ATTACK trial）. Lancet Infect Dis. 2023;23(9):1072-1084.</li><li>Holland TL, Cosgrove SE, Doernberg SB, et al. Ceftobiprole for Treatment of Complicated Staphylococcus aureus Bacteremia （ERADICATE trial）. N Engl J Med. 2023;389(15):1390-1401.</li><li>Sawyer RG, Claridge JA, Nathens AB, et al. Trial of Short-Course Antimicrobial Therapy for Intraabdominal Infection（STOP-IT）. N Engl J Med. 2015;372(21):1996-2005.</li><li>Li HK, Rombach I, Zambellas R, et al. Oral versus Intravenous Antibiotics for Bone and Joint Infection（OVIVA）. N Engl J Med. 2019;380(5):425-436.</li><li>Iversen K, Ihlemann N, Gill SU, et al. Partial Oral versus Intravenous Antibiotic Treatment of Endocarditis（POET）. N Engl J Med. 2019;380(5):415-424.</li><li>Copaescu AM, Vogrin S, James F, et al. Efficacy of a Clinical Decision Rule to Enable Direct Oral Challenge in Patients With Low-Risk Penicillin Allergy（PALACE trial）. JAMA Intern Med. 2023;183(9):944-952.</li><li>U.S. Food and Drug Administration. FDA approves new antibiotic for three different uses（ZEVTERA / ceftobiprole medocaril）. April 3, 2024.</li><li>U.S. Food and Drug Administration. Approval of XACDURO (sulbactam-durlobactam). May 2023.｜EMBLAVEO (aztreonam- avibactam)：EU 2024 / US 2025 核准。</li><li>Zhanel GG, Walkty AJ, Karlowsky JA. Fosfomycin: A First-Line Oral Therapy for Acute Uncomplicated Cystitis. Can J Infect Dis Med Microbiol. 2016;2016:2082693.</li><li>Karruli A, Migliaccio A, Pournaras S, et al. Cefiderocol and Sulbactam-Durlobactam against Carbapenem-Resistant Acinetobacter baumannii. Antibiotics. 2023;12(12):1729.</li><li>Bush K, Bradford PA. Epidemiology of β-Lactamase-Producing Pathogens. Clin Microbiol Rev. 2020;33(2):e00047-19.（Ambler 分類與抑 制劑對應）</li><li>衛生福利部疾病管制署．台灣醫療照護相關感染監視及抗藥性監測系統（THAS／TNIS）季報，2024–2025 年度。</li><li>衛生福利部中央健康保險署．全民健康保險藥物給付項目及支付標準——第 10 節 抗微生物劑（10.3.5 Ceftaroline、10.3.6 Ceftazidime+Avibactam 等給付規定）。</li><li>衛生福利部食品藥物管理署．公告含 Fosfomycin 成分藥品之臨床效益及風險再評估結果（限縮適應症並修訂仿單）。</li><li>台灣感染症醫學會、台灣感染管制學會．抗生素抗藥性相關共識與衛教資料，2023–2025。</li><li>各院年度抗生素敏感性報告（Antibiogram）——這是你最該讀、也最少人讀的一份文件。</li><li>The Sanford Guide to Antimicrobial Therapy（熱病），最新年度版。</li><li>Mandell, Douglas, and Bennett&#x27;s Principles and Practice of Infectious Diseases, 10th ed.</li><li>Johns Hopkins ABX Guide／UpToDate／IDSA Practice Guidelines 線上資源。</li></ol></div></details>"
